{"id":"n46969-1-7","stage":4,"title":"대피 · 躲避","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n46969-1-7-1","ko":"아랫집에 불이 난 것 같아요!","zh":"好像楼下的房子着火啦！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아랫집에","meaning":"下家邻居","explanation":"아랫집：下家邻居；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아랫집","audio":"/audio/553c5b006533f2da9b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66798","senseId":"1","lemma":"아랫집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아랫집에","audio":"/audio/e5bd05f2dec733d3c98c.mp3"}},{"text":"불이","meaning":"火灾","explanation":"불：火灾；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"3","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불이","audio":"/audio/9312b03715e82a6ac161.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아요!","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"553c5b006533f2da","term":"아랫집","zh":"下家邻居","audio":"/audio/553c5b006533f2da9b27.mp3","entryId":"66798","definition":"在下方为邻或在低处的房子。","pronunciation":["아래찝","아랟찝"]},{"id":"05e6efdf147502fc","term":"불","zh":"火灾","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3","entryId":"61154","definition":"房子或东西被烧的灾祸或灾难。","pronunciation":["불"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c8af32fc7f10f0d7ebe.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n46969-1-7-2","ko":"빨리 옥상으로 대피를 해야겠어!","zh":"得赶紧去屋顶避难啊！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"옥상으로","meaning":"屋顶，房顶，屋顶平台","explanation":"옥상：屋顶，房顶，屋顶平台；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"옥상","audio":"/audio/eebd6ed03c8fe3edca33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22046","senseId":"1","lemma":"옥상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옥상으로","audio":"/audio/3b6344f81bb479c69354.mp3"}},{"text":"대피를","meaning":"躲避，隐蔽","explanation":"대피：躲避，隐蔽；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"대피","audio":"/audio/8d253ba16888cd119890.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46969","senseId":"1","lemma":"대피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대피를","audio":"/audio/b3ceeb1df0fbbe1e6e3a.mp3"}},{"text":"해야겠어!","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야겠어","audio":"/audio/3114ef489ad78871250b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"eebd6ed03c8fe3ed","term":"옥상","zh":"屋顶，房顶，屋顶平台","audio":"/audio/eebd6ed03c8fe3edca33.mp3","entryId":"22046","definition":"在现代式的建筑中，为能利用而把屋顶建成平面的地方。","pronunciation":["옥쌍"]},{"id":"8d253ba16888cd11","term":"대피","zh":"躲避，隐蔽","audio":"/audio/8d253ba16888cd119890.mp3","entryId":"46969","definition":"避开危险，暂时前往安全的地方。","pronunciation":["대ː피"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/abc79cdf7e3cebdbd804.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.009,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=46969","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":143,"sequenceScore":2.8357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["得赶紧去屋顶避难啊！","好像楼下的房子着火啦！","爸爸去哪儿了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好像楼下的房子着火啦！","爸爸去哪儿了？","得赶紧去屋顶避难啊！"],"answer":2}]}
